[a17: re-implemented on the restructured LightBarControllerImpl: QS forces dark
 bars only in night mode (the a16 boolean expression is replaced by this
 simpler equivalent of its intent)]

(cherry picked from commit 249534a3e5b5e53b5fe7bc9666eb88119fb39a84)
